  "scope": "In the original rational family with 0<=beta<=3/4, every physical positive renewal seed reaches the old protection rectangle in finite time iff beta<=5/12. The critical equality case retains a positive seed and improves its own influence conditions. Partial correction joins the inherited support-cover, original guarded history and withdrawal certificate without a resource reset. Supercritical low boxes persist; arbitrarily small constant adverse quality error invalidates the universal critical guarantee. No complete basin, empirical threshold, endogenous intervention formation, market-entry adapter, minimal cost or general noisy recovery theorem."
}
